OL,3,GNEWSA'My biggest fear was getting      
OL,4,Achanged in front of them' - why teenage
OL,5,Agirls stop playing sport               
OL,7,FWhen Kate Laing was 15 she stopped     
OL,8,Ftaking part in school sports.          
OL,10,FShe had enjoyed physical education (PE)
OL,11,Fduring her early years at secondary    
OL,12,Fschool, but as she got older she began 
OL,13,Fto get bullied and was scared of what  
OL,14,Fthe other girls might do.              
OL,16,F"My biggest fear was getting changed in
OL,17,Ffront of them and how they could use   
OL,18,Fthat against me," Kate says.           
