OL,3,GNEWSA'My biggest fear was getting      
OL,4,Achanged in front of them' - why teenage
OL,5,Agirls stop playing sport               
OL,7,FEventually, her anxiety became so      
OL,8,Fsignificant that she asked her mum to  
OL,9,Fwrite to the school so she could avoid 
OL,10,Fusing the changing rooms altogether.   
